# Personal Homebrew packages: `brew bundle --no-upgrade --file macos/Brewfile`
# (install-macos.sh runs it). Installs what's missing; never upgrades or removes.
#
# Not here on purpose:
#   - runtimes managed by mise (shared/mise/config.toml): node, pnpm, yarn, uv, ...
#   - mise itself: installed with `curl https://mise.run | sh` into ~/.local/bin
#   - apps installed outside Homebrew (VS Code, Karabiner, browsers, ...)
#   - work tooling
#
# Third-party taps must be trusted before Homebrew loads their casks; see
# TRUSTED_TAPS in install-macos.sh.

